" │ ✻ phasewise 0.3.0                        │                                                       "
" │   demo · main                            │                                                       "
" ╰─────────────────────╭───────────────────────────────────────────────────╮                        "
"                       │ Shortcuts                                         │                        "
" Demo plan             │                                                   │                        "
" phasewise.md · 3 phase│ Run                                               │                        "
"    1  Scaffold the pro│ enter       start the run, or open the active one │                        "
"    2  Add the parser  │ o           open the last run                     │                        "
"    3  Write the docs a│                                                   │                        "
"                       │ Plan                                              │                        "
" Agent   Claude Code 2.│ p           write a new plan with the agent       │                        "
" Model   sonnet · from │ c           commit the plan                       │                        "
" Effort  Default · Clau│                                                   │                        "
"                       │ Settings                                          │                        "
" any key close         │ a           switch the agent (resets the model)   │                        "
"                       │ m           choose the model                      │                        "
"                       │ e           choose the effort                     │                        "
"                       │                                                   │                        "
"                       │ General                                           │                        "
"                       │ esc         stop the plan being written           │                        "
"                       │ ?           show or hide the shortcuts            │                        "
"                       │ q / Ctrl-C  quit                                  │                        "
"                       ╰───────────────────────────────────────────────────╯                        "
